<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Medication Refill Reminder</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .container {
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 5px;
    }
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .logo {
      max-width: 150px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .greeting {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .medications {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .medications th, .medications td {
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      padding: 8px;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .medications th {
      background-color: #f2f2f2;
    }
    .cta {
      background-color: #4CAF50;
      color: white;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #666;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Medication Refill Reminder</h1>
      <p>{{store.name}}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="greeting">
      <p>Dear {{customer.firstName}} {{customer.lastName}},</p>
      <p>This is a friendly reminder that it's time to refill your medication(s). According to our records, you're due for a refill today.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="medications-section">
      <h3>Your Medications</h3>
      <table class="medications">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Medication</th>
            <th>Last Filled</th>
            <th>Quantity</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {{#each transaction.items}}
            <tr>
              <td>{{this.product.name}}</td>
              <td>{{formatDateShort ../transaction.saleDate}}</td>
              <td>{{this.quantity}}</td>
            </tr>
          {{/each}}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="action">
      <p>You can refill your prescription by:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Calling us at {{store.phone}}</li>
        <li>Visiting our pharmacy in person</li>
        <li>Replying to this email</li>
        <li>Using our mobile app or website</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="{{store.website}}" class="cta">Refill Online Now</a>
    </div>

    <div class="additional-info">
      <p>Your original prescription number: {{transaction.saleNumber}}</p>
      {{#if transaction.prescription}}
        <p>Prescription #: {{transaction.prescription.prescriptionNumber}}</p>
      {{/if}}
      <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, please don't hesitate to contact us.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>{{store.name}}</p>
      <p>Phone: {{store.phone}} | Email: {{store.email}}</p>
      <p>Website: {{store.website}}</p>
      <p>This reminder was sent on {{formatDate date}}</p>
      <p>If you wish to unsubscribe from these reminders, please contact us.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
